                                "sense_id": "d64adb4a-b497-3b58-9e3f-58e568c54c01",
                                "text": "From six large buildings, along six different pathways, walk, hobble, or shuffle nearly 250 white-coated and blue-panted figures to the great Central Hall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa86f19c-dd4a-4b8c-9255-13fd220c13df",
                                "sense_id": "d64adb4a-b497-3b58-9e3f-58e568c54c01",
                                "text": "An inside contact reports that fashion artists are being told to draw their panted women to \"look like lesbians.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e54e9c6-3e9c-419e-aebb-91c0d814d368",
                                "sense_id": "d64adb4a-b497-3b58-9e3f-58e568c54c01",
                                "text": "The long-haired hippie, unwashed and unshaved, walked into Imelda’s drawing room, or the leather-panted woman striding in with the air of one who had ridden through cowboy country and tied her sweating horse at the Palace gate:[…]"
